<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 364 0 R
/T (Motor Neuron Disease, or MND, is a neurological disease that stops the communication betweenn the brain and the motor neurons, the nerves that control body movement.)
/E (Motor Neuron Disease, or MND, is a neurological disease that stops the communication betweenn the brain and the motor neurons, the nerves that control body movement.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
392 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 364 0 R
/T (The Disease is proressive, and terminal, resulting in patients typically loosing body movement, swallowing, talking, and breathing \(Basic Facts About MND - MND NZ, n.d.\).)
/E (The Disease is proressive, and terminal, resulting in patients typically loosing body movement, swallowing, talking, and breathing \(Basic Facts About MND - MND NZ, n.d.\).)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
393 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 364 0 R
/T (A common technology used by those with the disease in New Zealand are Augmentative and Alternative Communication devices, AAC, with eye tracking camera attachments, Primarily from SmartBox. These devices work as a typical windows device, and give people access to communication software. In some of the newer devices they include IR controller properties which can be programmed to work with common household devices such as TVs, but are often neglected due to their niche nature, and are put into the background of the devices software, making them difficult to set up for the average user.)
/E (A common technology used by those with the disease in New Zealand are Augmentative and Alternative Communication devices, AAC, with eye tracking camera attachments, Primarily from SmartBox. These devices work as a typical windows device, and give people access to communication software. In some of the newer devices they include IR controller properties which can be programmed to work with common household devices such as TVs, but are often neglected due to their niche nature, and are put into the background of the devices software, making them difficult to set up for the average user.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
