2144 0 obj
<<
/Title (A common technology used by those with the disease in New Zealand are Augmentative and Alternative Communication devices, AAC, with eye tracking camera attachments, Primarily from SmartBox. These devices work as a typical windows device, and give people access to communication software. In some of the newer devices they include IR controller properties which can be programmed to work with common household devices such as TVs, but are often neglected due to their niche nature, and are put into the background of the devices software, making them difficult to set up for the average user.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1014 0 R
/Prev 2544 0 R
>>
